-- מקור: סעיף 1. סעיף תכלית; אינו מבחן זכאות עצמאי.
`statutory purpose` MEANS "Professional competence; practitioner and public safety; environmental protection"

-- מקור: סעיף 2. 
GIVEN `removes heat from matter or space` IS A BOOLEAN
      `uses refrigerant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a statutory system` `removes heat from matter or space` `uses refrigerant` IS
    `removes heat from matter or space` AND `uses refrigerant`

-- מקור: סעיף 2. הספים כוללים 18 ו-70; זהו רכיב אחד בלבד בהתאמת הרישיון.
GIVEN `grade` IS A LicenceGrade
      `cooling capacity kW` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `capacity is within grade` `grade` `cooling capacity kW` IS
    `cooling capacity kW` AT LEAST 0
    AND (CONSIDER `grade`
         WHEN Grade1 THEN `cooling capacity kW` AT MOST 18
         WHEN Grade2 THEN `cooling capacity kW` AT MOST 70
         WHEN Grade3 THEN TRUE)

