-- מקור: סעיף 63. אומת בספר החוקים 3349.
`original publication date` MEANS YMD 2025 1 14

-- מקור: סעיף 63. תלות חיצונית בתקנות האגרות; ראו המקורות במסמך הנלווה.
`verified fee regulations commencement` MEANS YMD 2025 7 16

-- מקור: סעיף 63. 
GIVEN `fee regulations commencement` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `general commencement` `fee regulations commencement` IS
    `the later of` (`add months` `original publication date` 3) `fee regulations commencement`

-- מקור: סעיף 63. 
`verified general commencement` MEANS `general commencement` `verified fee regulations commencement`

-- מקור: סעיף 63. 
GIVEN `general start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `other refrigerants commencement` `general start` IS
    `add months` `general start` 18

-- מקור: סעיף 63. רשימת הגזים אינה כשלעצמה היתר שימוש; חוקיות השימוש היא קלט נפרד.
GIVEN `evaluation date` IS A DATE
      `general start` IS A DATE
      `listed and lawfully permitted refrigerant` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `work provisions have commenced` `evaluation date` `general start` `listed and lawfully permitted refrigerant` IS
    IF `evaluation date` LESS THAN `general start`
    THEN Rejected
    ELSE IF `evaluation date` AT LEAST (`other refrigerants commencement` `general start`)
         THEN Established
         ELSE `listed and lawfully permitted refrigerant`

-- מקור: סעיף 63. העדר מידע על תקנות ההפחתה אינו שקול לקביעה שלא פורסמו או שנכנסו לתוקף.
GIVEN `evaluation date` IS A DATE
      `general start` IS A DATE
      `reduction regulations start` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `enforcement chapter has commenced` `evaluation date` `general start` `reduction regulations start` IS
    IF `evaluation date` LESS THAN (`other refrigerants commencement` `general start`)
    THEN Rejected
    ELSE CONSIDER `reduction regulations start`
         WHEN JUST start THEN `finding from boolean` (`evaluation date` AT LEAST (`the later of` (`other refrigerants commencement` `general start`) start))
         WHEN NOTHING THEN Unresolved

DECLARE WorkCase HAS
    `commencement` IS A Finding
    `system in scope` IS A Finding
    `work` IS A WorkKind
    `capacity kW` IS A NUMBER
    `licence` IS A MAYBE LicenceGrade
    `licence in force` IS A Finding
    `licence conditions complied with` IS A Finding
    `other applicable provisions complied with` IS A Finding
    `effective exemption order covers work` IS A Finding
    `exemption order conditions complied with` IS A Finding

-- מקור: סעיף 3. תוצאה מוגבלת לסעיף 3 ולהכרעות שנמסרו. Satisfied אינו היתר כולל לפי כל דין.
GIVEN `case` IS A WorkCase
GIVETH A Assessment
DECIDE `assess work under section three` `case` IS
    IF `case`'s `commencement` EQUALS Rejected OR `case`'s `system in scope` EQUALS Rejected OR `case`'s `work` EQUALS OutsideSchedule
    THEN NotApplicable
    ELSE IF `case`'s `commencement` EQUALS Unresolved OR `case`'s `system in scope` EQUALS Unresolved OR `case`'s `work` EQUALS UnclassifiedWork OR `case`'s `capacity kW` LESS THAN 0
         THEN NeedsReview
         ELSE IF `case`'s `effective exemption order covers work` EQUALS Established
              THEN `assessment from finding` (`case`'s `exemption order conditions complied with`)
              ELSE IF `case`'s `effective exemption order covers work` EQUALS Unresolved
                   THEN NeedsReview
                   ELSE CONSIDER `case`'s `licence`
                        WHEN NOTHING THEN NotSatisfied
                        WHEN JUST grade THEN
                            IF NOT (`capacity is within grade` grade (`case`'s `capacity kW`) AND `grade covers classified work` grade (`case`'s `work`))
                            THEN NotSatisfied
                            ELSE `assessment from finding` (`both findings` (`case`'s `licence in force`) (`both findings` (`case`'s `licence conditions complied with`) (`case`'s `other applicable provisions complied with`)))

-- מקור: סעיף 3. 
GIVEN `council consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `minister satisfied there is no safety risk` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `conditions for exemption order` `council consulted` `minister satisfied there is no safety risk` IS
    `both findings` (`finding from boolean` `council consulted`) `minister satisfied there is no safety risk`

-- מקור: סעיף 3. ביצוע עבודה בניגוד לסעיף 3
-- הפעלה: עבודה שבתחולה; assessment = NotSatisfied
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 3 licensing prohibition` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         SHANT EXACTLY Section3LicensingProhibitionAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- מקור: סעיף 3. מתן צו פטור וקביעת תנאים
-- הפעלה: לאחר שהתקיימו התנאים למתן צו פטור
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 3 exemption power` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         MAY EXACTLY Section3ExemptionPowerAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- מקור: סעיף 4. רישיון גבוה אינו בהכרח החזקה ברישיון מסוג אחר לצורך אופן הפרסום.
GIVEN `claims any licence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `has any licence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `claims specific grade` IS A BOOLEAN
      `holds that specific grade` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `advertisement violates section four` `claims any licence` `has any licence` `claims specific grade` `holds that specific grade` IS
    (`claims any licence` AND NOT `has any licence`) OR (`claims specific grade` AND NOT `holds that specific grade`)

-- מקור: סעיף 4. פרסום מצג רישוי כוזב
-- הפעלה: רק כאשר advertisement violates section four = TRUE
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 4 false advertising ban` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         SHANT EXACTLY Section4FalseAdvertisingBanAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- מקור: סעיף 5. הגשת בקשה לרשם
-- הפעלה: כוונה לקבל או לחדש רישיון
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
`section 5 application duty` `actor` `case reference` MEANS
    PARTY `actor`
    MUST EXACTLY Section5ApplicationDutyAction `actor` `case reference`

-- מקור: סעיף 5. דרישת מידע ומסמכים הדרושים להחלטה
-- הפעלה: דרישה הקשורה לבקשה ומידע הדרוש להחלטה
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 5 information power` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         MAY EXACTLY Section5InformationPowerAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- מקור: סעיף 5. פרסום אופן הבקשה ורשימת המסמכים באתר המשרד
-- הפעלה: ניהול הליך הרישוי
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
`section 5 publication duty` `actor` `case reference` MEANS
    PARTY `actor`
    MUST EXACTLY Section5PublicationDutyAction `actor` `case reference`

DECLARE TrainingRoute IS ONE OF A1Training, A1School, A2, A3, B1Training, B1School, B2, B3, B4, B5, B6, C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8

DECLARE PriorQualifications HAS
    `grade one licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `grade two licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `grade one graduation certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `grade two graduation certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `vocational HVAC certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `vocational youth HVAC certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `climate three units certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `climate five units certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered HVAC technician` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered HVAC practical engineer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered mechanical engineer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `integrated supplementary course completed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `experience years in preceding three years` IS A NUMBER
    `experience years in preceding seven years` IS A NUMBER

-- מקור: סעיף 6. 
GIVEN `route` IS A TrainingRoute
GIVETH A LicenceGrade
DECIDE `route licence grade` `route` IS
    CONSIDER `route`
    WHEN A1Training THEN Grade1
    WHEN A1School THEN Grade1
    WHEN A2 THEN Grade1
    WHEN A3 THEN Grade1
    WHEN B1Training THEN Grade2
    WHEN B1School THEN Grade2
    WHEN B2 THEN Grade2
    WHEN B3 THEN Grade2
    WHEN B4 THEN Grade2
    WHEN B5 THEN Grade2
    WHEN B6 THEN Grade2
    WHEN C1 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C2 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C3 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C4 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C5 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C6 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C7 THEN Grade3
    WHEN C8 THEN Grade3

-- מקור: סעיף 6. זהו גבול היקף ההכשרה במסלול; אינו מספר שעות מזערי לזכאות.
GIVEN `route` IS A TrainingRoute
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `route maximum training hours` `route` IS
    CONSIDER `route`
    WHEN A1Training THEN JUST 350
    WHEN A1School THEN NOTHING
    WHEN A2 THEN JUST 220
    WHEN A3 THEN JUST 50
    WHEN B1Training THEN JUST 480
    WHEN B1School THEN NOTHING
    WHEN B2 THEN NOTHING
    WHEN B3 THEN JUST 100
    WHEN B4 THEN JUST 330
    WHEN B5 THEN JUST 50
    WHEN B6 THEN JUST 50
    WHEN C1 THEN JUST 720
    WHEN C2 THEN NOTHING
    WHEN C3 THEN JUST 290
    WHEN C4 THEN JUST 240
    WHEN C5 THEN JUST 455
    WHEN C6 THEN JUST 200
    WHEN C7 THEN JUST 50
    WHEN C8 THEN JUST 230

-- מקור: סעיף 6,63. סיום החלון מיוצג כגבול שאינו נכלל; שאלת היום האחרון וספירת מועדים טעונה בדיקה בהפעלה.
GIVEN `application date` IS A DATE
      `general start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `experience transition is open` `application date` `general start` IS
    `application date` AT LEAST `general start` AND `application date` LESS THAN (`add years` `general start` 3)

-- מקור: סעיף 6. ניסיון מצטבר בעבודות במערכות, לפני הגשת הבקשה; ההוכחה וסיווג הניסיון חיצוניים.
GIVEN `prior` IS A PriorQualifications
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `prior experience route condition` `prior` IS
    (`prior`'s `experience years in preceding three years` AT LEAST 1)
    OR (`prior`'s `experience years in preceding seven years` AT LEAST 3)

-- מקור: סעיף 6. 
GIVEN `route` IS A TrainingRoute
      `prior` IS A PriorQualifications
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `prior conditions for route` `route` `prior` IS
    CONSIDER `route`
    WHEN A1Training THEN TRUE
    WHEN A1School THEN `prior`'s `climate three units certificate`
    WHEN A2 THEN `prior experience route condition` `prior`
    WHEN A3 THEN `prior`'s `vocational HVAC certificate`
    WHEN B1Training THEN TRUE
    WHEN B1School THEN `prior`'s `climate five units certificate`
    WHEN B2 THEN (`prior`'s `registered HVAC technician` AND `prior`'s `integrated supplementary course completed`)
    WHEN B3 THEN (`prior`'s `grade one licence` OR `prior`'s `grade one graduation certificate` OR `prior`'s `climate three units certificate`)
    WHEN B4 THEN `prior experience route condition` `prior`
    WHEN B5 THEN (`prior`'s `vocational HVAC certificate` OR `prior`'s `vocational youth HVAC certificate` OR `prior`'s `climate five units certificate`)
    WHEN B6 THEN `prior`'s `registered HVAC technician`
    WHEN C1 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C2 THEN (`prior`'s `registered HVAC practical engineer` AND `prior`'s `integrated supplementary course completed`)
    WHEN C3 THEN (`prior`'s `grade one licence` OR `prior`'s `grade one graduation certificate` OR `prior`'s `climate three units certificate`)
    WHEN C4 THEN (`prior`'s `grade two licence` OR `prior`'s `grade two graduation certificate` OR `prior`'s `climate five units certificate`)
    WHEN C5 THEN `prior experience route condition` `prior`
    WHEN C6 THEN `prior`'s `vocational HVAC certificate`
    WHEN C7 THEN `prior`'s `registered HVAC practical engineer`
    WHEN C8 THEN `prior`'s `registered mechanical engineer`

-- מקור: סעיף 6. 
GIVEN `route` IS A TrainingRoute
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `route requires additional course` `route` IS
    CONSIDER `route`
    WHEN A1Training THEN TRUE
    WHEN A1School THEN FALSE
    WHEN A2 THEN TRUE
    WHEN A3 THEN TRUE
    WHEN B1Training THEN TRUE
    WHEN B1School THEN FALSE
    WHEN B2 THEN FALSE
    WHEN B3 THEN TRUE
    WHEN B4 THEN TRUE
    WHEN B5 THEN TRUE
    WHEN B6 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C1 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C2 THEN FALSE
    WHEN C3 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C4 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C5 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C6 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C7 THEN TRUE
    WHEN C8 THEN TRUE

-- מקור: סעיף 6. קלט ההשלמה משמעו ההכשרה המתאימה, אישור התוכנית לפי סעיף 19, תעודה ובחינות כנדרש; שעות לבדן אינן מספיקות.
GIVEN `route` IS A TrainingRoute
      `prior` IS A PriorQualifications
      `application date` IS A DATE
      `general start` IS A DATE
      `required qualifying course and certificate completed` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `schedule two route satisfied` `route` `prior` `application date` `general start` `required qualifying course and certificate completed` IS
    IF NOT (`prior conditions for route` `route` `prior`)
    THEN Rejected
    ELSE IF (`route` EQUALS A2 OR `route` EQUALS B4 OR `route` EQUALS C5) AND NOT (`experience transition is open` `application date` `general start`)
         THEN Rejected
         ELSE IF `route requires additional course` `route`
              THEN `required qualifying course and certificate completed`
              ELSE Established

-- מקור: סעיף 6. 
GIVEN `adult` IS A Finding
      `citizen or resident of Israel` IS A Finding
      `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar` IS A Finding
      `training requirement satisfied` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `ordinary licensing conditions` `adult` `citizen or resident of Israel` `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar` `training requirement satisfied` IS
    `both findings` `adult` (`both findings` `citizen or resident of Israel` (`both findings` `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar` `training requirement satisfied`))

