      `licence within regulation seven items one to seven` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `electrical training exemption power conditions` `valid electricity licence` `licence within regulation seven items one to seven` IS
    `valid electricity licence` AND `licence within regulation seven items one to seven`

