-- הפעלה: ניהול הפטורים
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
`section 7 publication duty` `actor` `case reference` MEANS
    PARTY `actor`
    MUST EXACTLY Section7PublicationDutyAction `actor` `case reference`

-- מקור: סעיף 8. מניין השנה החמישית אינו מוכרע בקוד בלי הנחיה מוסמכת; מסופקות חלופות מפורשות במסמך.
GIVEN `issue date` IS A DATE
      `fifth year March date resolved by authority` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `ordinary licence expiry` `issue date` `fifth year March date resolved by authority` IS
    `the earlier of` (`add years` `issue date` 5) `fifth year March date resolved by authority`

-- מקור: סעיף 8. החרגת סעיף 6(א)(4) אינה מוחקת חובות השתלמות ותנאי רישיון אחרים.
GIVEN `adult` IS A Finding
      `citizen or resident of Israel` IS A Finding
      `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `renewal section six conditions` `adult` `citizen or resident of Israel` `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar` IS
    `both findings` `adult` (`both findings` `citizen or resident of Israel` `no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment as assessed by registrar`)

-- מקור: סעיף 9. אין דרישה לשש שנות ניסיון רצופות; נדרש ביצוע עבודה דומה בתוך שש השנים.
GIVEN `applicant from foreign country` IS A BOOLEAN
      `invited for system above seventy kW` IS A BOOLEAN
      `authorised abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
      `similar installation or maintenance in preceding six years` IS A BOOLEAN
      `registrar recognised reputation and expertise` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `foreign expert power conditions` `applicant from foreign country` `invited for system above seventy kW` `authorised abroad` `similar installation or maintenance in preceding six years` `registrar recognised reputation and expertise` IS
    `both findings` (`finding from boolean` (`applicant from foreign country` AND `invited for system above seventy kW` AND `authorised abroad` AND `similar installation or maintenance in preceding six years`)) `registrar recognised reputation and expertise`

-- מקור: סעיף 9. 
GIVEN `start` IS A DATE
      `end` IS A DATE
      `previous renewals` IS A NUMBER
      `is renewal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `temporary licence period allowed` `start` `end` `previous renewals` `is renewal` IS
    `end` GREATER THAN `start`
    AND `end` AT MOST (`add years` `start` 1)
    AND `previous renewals` AT LEAST 0
    AND `previous renewals` EQUALS FLOOR `previous renewals`
    AND ((NOT `is renewal`) OR `previous renewals` LESS THAN 2)

-- מקור: סעיף 9. מתן או חידוש רישיון דרגה 3 זמני למומחה זר
-- הפעלה: תנאי סעיף 9 וגבולות התקופה התקיימו; אין חובה לתת את הרישיון
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 9 foreign licence power` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         MAY EXACTLY Section9ForeignLicencePowerAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- מקור: סעיף 10. 
GIVEN `false mistaken misleading or incomplete application` IS A BOOLEAN
      `grant condition ceased` IS A BOOLEAN
      `licence condition breached` IS A BOOLEAN
      `statutory duty related to licensed activity breached` IS A BOOLEAN
      `false misleading mistaken or incomplete required information` IS A BOOLEAN
      `dangerous unprofessionalism or negligence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section ten general ground` `false mistaken misleading or incomplete application` `grant condition ceased` `licence condition breached` `statutory duty related to licensed activity breached` `false misleading mistaken or incomplete required information` `dangerous unprofessionalism or negligence` IS
    `false mistaken misleading or incomplete application`
    OR `grant condition ceased`
    OR `licence condition breached`
    OR `statutory duty related to licensed activity breached`
    OR `false misleading mistaken or incomplete required information`
    OR `dangerous unprofessionalism or negligence`

