DECIDE `section ten ordinary suspension period allowed` `start` `end` IS
    `end` AT LEAST `start` AND `end` AT MOST (`add years` `start` 3)

-- מקור: סעיף 10. סעיף 10(ב): עד פסק דין סופי, בלי להעתיק את תקרת שלוש השנים מסעיף 10(א).
GIVEN `relevant indictment filed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `final judgment not yet given` IS A BOOLEAN
      `seriousness or public interest requires suspension` IS A Finding
      `council consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `written hearing opportunity given` IS A BOOLEAN
