DECIDE `indictment suspension power conditions` `relevant indictment filed` `final judgment not yet given` `seriousness or public interest requires suspension` `council consulted` `written hearing opportunity given` IS
    `both findings` (`finding from boolean` (`relevant indictment filed` AND `final judgment not yet given` AND `council consulted` AND `written hearing opportunity given`)) `seriousness or public interest requires suspension`

