GIVEN `hearing period including lawful extension expired` IS A BOOLEAN
      `arguments submitted in time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `intention notice becomes demand` `hearing period including lawful extension expired` `arguments submitted in time` IS
    `hearing period including lawful extension expired` AND NOT `arguments submitted in time`

-- מקור: סעיף 45. המועד האחרון בחלון השנתיים טעון החלת דיני מניין מועדים; המודל משתמש בגבול שאינו נכלל.
GIVEN `same provision` IS A BOOLEAN
      `previous violation date` IS A DATE
      `new violation date` IS A DATE
      `previous penalty imposed or conviction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `ordinary repeat violation` `same provision` `previous violation date` `new violation date` `previous penalty imposed or conviction` IS
    `same provision` AND `previous penalty imposed or conviction` AND `new violation date` GREATER THAN `previous violation date` AND `new violation date` LESS THAN (`add years` `previous violation date` 2)

-- מקור: סעיף 45. תוספת חודשית של 1/50 מן הבסיס; תוספת חזרה בגובה הבסיס. יחידות החודש והצטברות שניהם הן הכרעת יישום מתועדת.
GIVEN `updated base amount` IS A NUMBER
      `continuing months determined` IS A NUMBER
      `repeat violation established` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `penalty before reduction` `updated base amount` `continuing months determined` `repeat violation established` IS
    `updated base amount` TIMES (1 PLUS (`continuing months determined` DIVIDED BY 50) PLUS (IF `repeat violation established` THEN 1 ELSE 0))

-- מקור: סעיף 46. אין שיקול דעת חופשי להפחתת עיצום ללא התקנות.
GIVEN `amount before reduction` IS A NUMBER
      `proposed amount` IS A NUMBER
      `reduction regulations authorise circumstances and rate` IS A Finding
GIVETH A Finding
DECIDE `permitted reduction` `amount before reduction` `proposed amount` `reduction regulations authorise circumstances and rate` IS
    IF `proposed amount` EQUALS `amount before reduction`
    THEN Established
    ELSE IF `proposed amount` LESS THAN 0 OR `proposed amount` GREATER THAN `amount before reduction`
         THEN Rejected
         ELSE `reduction regulations authorise circumstances and rate`

-- מקור: סעיף 47. 
GIVEN `notice date` IS A DATE
      `demand date` IS A DATE
      `arguments not submitted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `appeal filed and payment stayed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `appeal decision date` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `penalty valuation date` `notice date` `demand date` `arguments not submitted` `appeal filed and payment stayed` `appeal decision date` IS
    IF `appeal filed and payment stayed`
    THEN `appeal decision date`
    ELSE JUST (IF `arguments not submitted` THEN `notice date` ELSE `demand date`)

-- מקור: סעיף 47. החוק קובע מכפלה קרובה של 10; מדדים ומדיניות תיקו נמסרים מבחוץ. עדיף סכום רשמי שפורסם.
GIVEN `previous amount` IS A NUMBER
      `current known index` IS A NUMBER
      `previous known index` IS A NUMBER
      `round exact half upward` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `annual indexed amount with explicit tie rule` `previous amount` `current known index` `previous known index` `round exact half upward` IS
    IF `previous amount` LESS THAN 0 OR `current known index` AT MOST 0 OR `previous known index` AT MOST 0
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (10 TIMES (IF fraction LESS THAN 0.5
                        THEN FLOOR units
                        ELSE IF fraction GREATER THAN 0.5 OR `round exact half upward`
                             THEN (FLOOR units) PLUS 1
                             ELSE FLOOR units))
    WHERE
        units MEANS (`previous amount` TIMES `current known index` DIVIDED BY `previous known index`) DIVIDED BY 10
        fraction MEANS units MINUS FLOOR units

