DECLARE RulemakingKind IS ONE OF ExemptSystemClasses, AmendScheduleOne, AmendScheduleTwo, AmendScheduleThree, SetReductions, SetFees, TrainingAndExaminations, ExaminerQualifications, ApplicationProcedure, ForeignExpertProcedure, AmendScheduleFour

-- מקור: סעיף 3,6,41,46,59,60,63. זהו מבחן הליכי בלבד; תוכן הצו, הסמכות, פרסום, מגבלות ותחילה נבדקים בנוסף.
GIVEN `kind` IS A RulemakingKind
      `council consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `labour welfare committee approved` IS A BOOLEAN
      `justice minister consent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `environment minister consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `relevant minister consulted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `rulemaking procedural conditions` `kind` `council consulted` `labour welfare committee approved` `justice minister consent` `environment minister consulted` `relevant minister consulted` IS
    CONSIDER `kind`
    WHEN ExemptSystemClasses THEN `council consulted`
    WHEN AmendScheduleOne THEN `labour welfare committee approved`
    WHEN AmendScheduleTwo THEN `labour welfare committee approved`
    WHEN AmendScheduleThree THEN `labour welfare committee approved` AND `justice minister consent`
    WHEN SetReductions THEN `labour welfare committee approved` AND `justice minister consent`
    WHEN SetFees THEN `labour welfare committee approved`
    WHEN TrainingAndExaminations THEN `labour welfare committee approved`
    WHEN ExaminerQualifications THEN `labour welfare committee approved` AND `relevant minister consulted`
    WHEN ApplicationProcedure THEN TRUE
    WHEN ForeignExpertProcedure THEN TRUE
    WHEN AmendScheduleFour THEN `environment minister consulted`

-- מקור: סעיף 60. התקנת תקנות לביצוע החוק, הכשרות, בחינות, בודקים והליכי בקשה
-- הפעלה: תנאי ההליך לפי הנושא התקיימו; קביעת תוכן נורמטיבי דורשת החלטה אנושית
GIVEN `actor` IS A Actor
      `case reference` IS A STRING
      `preconditions established` IS A BOOLEAN
`section 60 rulemaking power` `actor` `case reference` `preconditions established` MEANS
    IF `preconditions established`
    THEN PARTY `actor`
         MAY EXACTLY Section60RulemakingPowerAction `actor` `case reference`
    ELSE FULFILLED

